                                                "sense_id": "3a6fca95-1b47-3769-8ba2-5ef24778a701",
                                                "text": "The contest was a lot more even in the second half, as the wind swirled around the Stadium of Light, but it took Craig Gardner's superb block to prevent Young getting on the scoresheet."
